      <title>蓝牙耳机频繁断连，竟因速卖通后台播放静音音频</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/%E8%93%9D%E7%89%99%E8%80%B3%E6%9C%BA%E9%A2%91%E7%B9%81%E6%96%AD%E8%BF%9E%E7%AB%9F%E5%9B%A0%E9%80%9F%E5%8D%96%E9%80%9A%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E6%92%AD%E6%94%BE%E9%9D%99%E9%9F%B3%E9%9F%B3%E9%A2%91/</link>
